# What the "ENS setup" workflow does on its next run (edit and push to run it):
#   key            generate the ENS owner key in the job (kept in Vercel, never printed); the log shows its address
#   label <name>   register <name>.eth on ENSv2 (Sepolia) once that address holds Sepolia ETH
# Owner key generated (address 0x38e6C7622b2E9BdcB16821E88083274489625b74) and funded.
label ordo-mfg
